Firstly, I can recommend some fans this game just because you can drive 86 right after the first race and to the end, depending on your driving skill. Now, the list of what I didn't like:
-you can't minimize the game (you can, actually, but it will stop working after maximazing);
-phisycs in drift races and all others seem to be diffirent, and in drift you can't use techniques from real life;
-after a couple of hours of trying to play online, me and my friend just went to osu for the rest of the day;
-gamepad buttons in settings are signed with numbers, and you can distinguish only the triggers because they are signed as triggers.
Nevertheless, I am really enjoying the game, and I think it is a great purchase, but only as long as it is at least 75% off. Also, the graphics are surprisingly good for a simulator and especially for 2009.

